For a Raqio visual task, first read `RAQIO_VISUAL_GUIDE.md` at the repository root and inspect the primary reference image it names. Follow that guide, including the Blue Shadow template with topic-specific illustration, RIGHT-side blue opacity, and white typography/logo by default and final delivery to Downloads. Keep the actual visual rules in that one guide; this file only routes to it. Do not apply the artwork workflow to unrelated engineering tasks.
